# API-only build context. Keep Git history, MAUI, docs, local tools and secrets out.
**
!mobile/
!mobile/MzukuluQMS.Api/
!mobile/MzukuluQMS.Api/**

# Exclude local build/publish output and IDE deployment/authentication profiles.
**/bin/**
**/obj/**
**/Properties/**
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.vs/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*.publishsettings
# certs/supabase-db-ca.crt is public trust material and must remain included.
